### ============================================
### BOOKING SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/booking-locks
@lockID = 1

### Acquire booking lock
### Request Body: BookingLockDto
### Response: Created BookingLockDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bookingId": "uuid-booking-123",
  "tableId": "uuid-table-def",
  "lockAcquiredAt": "2024-06-20T10:00:00Z",
  "lockExpiresAt": "2024-06-20T10:05:00Z"
}

### Get booking locks by lock ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: BookingLockDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{lockID}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### List booking locks
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<BookingLockDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
#Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update booking lock details
### Request Body: BookingLockDto
### Response: Updated BookingLockDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{lockID}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Release a lock
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{lockID}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json